# SAVE drives the sections (the drums are sequenced, so nothing else does): a tap, a breakdown on the next bar, held
# as long as it is left; a tap, the build (four bars) and the drop; held, the drop at once; two taps
# before the bar, nothing. (128 BPM: a bar is 1875 ms.)
wav sections.wav
wait 300
expect sec 0
wait 62000
expect sec 0
tap SAVE
wait 50
expect sec 0
wait 2000
expect sec 1
shot breakdown.png
wait 12000
expect sec 1
tap SAVE
wait 2000
expect sec 2
shot build.png
wait 7600
expect sec 0
tap SAVE
wait 2000
expect sec 1
press SAVE
wait 700
release SAVE
wait 2000
expect sec 0
tap SAVE
wait 100
tap SAVE
wait 2000
expect sec 0
wavstop
